{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/EN_Story.png?t=1746810090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were expelled from Heavens and now you have to go back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a tower that will get you back.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect feathers and buy upgrades to build faster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to choose between 3 difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/Heavens.gif?t=1746810090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/EN_Cr.png?t=1746810090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No goal, no limitations - build to your heart content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/Rocks.gif?t=1746810090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/EN_Speed.png?t=1746810090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wanna claim yourself as &quot;The Fastest Mason&quot;? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be the fastest or the most effective brick builder out there? Check it out and get to leaderboards so everybody will know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/EN_Brickss.png?t=1746810090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There always is possibility, that next placed brick will give you a new brick style! So look out for them, and get the entire collection!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap